On-Premises Data Center
    │
    ├─ Network: 10.0.0.0/8
    └─ BGP ASN: 65000
        │
        ↓ (Direct Connect 10 Gbps)
        │
    AWS Direct Connect Location
        │
        ↓ (Private VIF)
        │
    Virtual Private Gateway (vgw-87654321)
        │
        ↓
    VPC (172.31.0.0/16)
        │
        ├─ Subnet A: 172.31.0.0/24
        ├─ Subnet B: 172.31.1.0/24
        └─ EC2 Instances
            └─ Connect via private IP
```

**Benefits:**
- Simple setup
- Dedicated connection to single VPC
- Predictable latency
- Private connectivity

