### Architecture 3: Multi-Location for Disaster Recovery

```
Primary Data Center (US-West)
    │
    ├─ 10.0.0.0/8
    └─ Direct Connect
        ├─ Location A: Equinix (Primary)
        └─ Location B: Digital Realty (Backup)
            │
            ↓ (Automatic Failover)
            │
        AWS Regions
            │
            ├─ us-west-1 (Primary)
