Secondary Data Center (US-East) - Optional Active-Active
    │
    ├─ 10.1.0.0/8
    └─ Direct Connect
        ├─ Location A: Equinix
        └─ Location B: Digital Realty
```

**Benefits:**
- Disaster recovery capability
